  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3102.03 Certified driver rehabilitation specialist (CDRS)",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-05-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3102.03 “Certified driver rehabilitation specialist (CDRS)” means a person certified by the Association for Driver Rehabilitation Specialists to plan, develop, coordinate and implement driver rehabilitation services for individuals with disabilities.\n\nSource. #5367, eff 3-31-92; ss by #6711, INTERIM, eff 3-22-98, EXPIRED: 7-20-98\n\nNew. #7362, eff 12-1-00; ss by #9331, INTERIM, eff 11-26-08, EXPIRED: 5-25-09\n\nNew. #9568, eff 10-17-09; ss by #12509, eff 4-5-18 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 3100",
